Z||000002||turbo86se||04-30-2000||10:40 AM||||The MillerWoods turbo is still alive and kicking!!  At least in my Fiero it is  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>From what I've heard the Design One turbo unit is a newer, upgraded unit from the Miller Woods unit. Although I've experienced zero problems with my turbo setup, considering it's been in there for about eight years.  <P>Just about 5 grand, installed from IRM in Maryland (I used to live in Frederick). Worth every penny!!!!<P>If you ever come down to Myrtle Beach, LMK, I'll take you for a ride!!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||10
Z||000003||88formula||04-30-2000||12:34 PM||||O-I didn't know that they were invented by the same person. turbo86se, I will take you up on that offer if I'm ever around that area.<P>Thanks.||||reg||1
